{"v":4,"catch":"一款輕鬆可愛的連色益智遊戲。","desc":"Threaded 是一款拼圖遊戲，所有內容都是關於將像素藝術圖片放在一起的！\n在不同的點之間畫出五顏六色的鏈接，並完成許多不同的原始像素藝術品。\n體驗簡單而有益的遊戲玩法、舒緩的視覺效果和音樂，甚至遊戲中的瑣事和有趣的事實——所有這些都在 Threaded 中！\n\n-72 個具有挑戰性的謎題！\n-可愛的刺繡像素拼圖藝術\n-有趣的瑣事問題\n-美麗輕鬆的原聲配樂\n-簡單的縮放和提示功能","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2022-04-28","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","荷蘭文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef91872cbed72d3413c7fd19bf3358b31429e6cc4d323e6fc7a842c7b8bb0809.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26637bf8d22f8d14c8ad432494debaf7a5d06e1614626f6badbbaebbdc026ebf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b4e9d477542a48f845526a3cbb4955c915ca4a29e688af12f17d3381cd628217.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3415decf001c9dc25708dc8735bc7d0d4178539a7a89804f2f3642e1df08eba7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/436e631416f999e926c8a45733419509de7c87b04a1e4b71122766449a86d5b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f4c62213aadf54c09720af4a2b32928b5cd2e7b5eac6cb8c6b1e2cc4b635aa3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100620017fb4000","dlc":[]}